[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/26.tres]光荣《三国志》系列[/font][/b]


历代均有出场。光荣英文条目描述：「Because he was an upright individual by nature, Zhu Jun became angered to be a tool in another guileless plot. His rage poisoned his health and he died of illness on the same day.」


[b][font=res://resource/font/FandolSong-Bold/26.tres]三国志战略版[/font][/b]


有普通版及SP版武将，侧重军事统帅能力。


